            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "That is simply how it currently works. The `completepopup` option did not exist when the popup functionality was implemented; consequently, the maximum height and width are not derived from specific options but are instead determined by identifying the largest available space. You can try testing the behavior with the `completepopup` PR and continue the discussion if any issues arise.",
